Louisiana QSO Party -- the 64 Louisiana parishes, each its own multiplier.
Codes from the sponsor's parish table (docs/ContestRules/QSOParties/Louisiana/LA-QSO-PARTY-Parishes.txt); the same 64 codes as DXLog.net LAQP.txt.
Names are the sponsor's spellings; the class maps SJB to ADIF's county name St John the Baptist (ADIFCountyName).
No parish maps to the state: the rules count parishes as multipliers of their own for every entrant.
No INCLUDE here: an out-of-state entrant's table holds only the parishes (the host-area rule reads it).
No line of this header may hold an equals sign: the reader takes any such line as an entry.

